# Cursor Internal Architecture — Workbench, Webviews, Glass UI, and DTS API

## Overview

Cursor v3.7.21 extends VS Code's workbench with a custom AI-first interface. This document covers the internal architecture: how the workbench HTML initializes, how the Composer webview communicates with the Electron main process, Cursor's Glass UI mode, the 21,000+ line DTS API extensions, Content Security Policy definitions, custom URI protocols, and the webview service worker architecture.

---

