## Background Composer Connection

Cursor uses a special **background composer** connection for AI operations that runs independently of the main workbench.

### Reconnection Logic

```javascript
function _isBackgroundComposerConnection(remoteAuthority) {
  // Background composer connections use a special mapping
  return remoteAuthority.startsWith('gn-');
}

// Grace period for background composer: 360 attempts
// Normal connections: standard reconnection timeout
const gracePeriod = _isBackgroundComposerConnection(authority)
  ? 360
  : 60;
```

### Architecture

```
Main Workbench
    │
    ├── Background Composer Connection (gn-*)
    │   ├── Longer grace period (360 attempts)
    │   ├── Non-fatal socket errors
    │   └── Special reconnection loop
    │
    └── Standard Connections
        ├── Normal grace period (60 attempts)
        ├── Fatal socket errors
        └── Standard reconnection
```

